note tools/estimation/test_est3c_tools.om -- Pure seeded OM-2 test suite for EST-3c v3
note tools (est3c_fit, est3c_eval, est3c_common) on synthetic data only.
note Composed after: est_defs.om est_math.om est_types.om est_kf.om est_mix.om
note                 est_pred.om est_v4.om est_replay.om est3c_common.om.
note Usage: test_est3c_tools <est3c_fit_t> <est3c_eval_t> <workdir>

